"Sumber: ECMWF IFS ENS 0,25° (51 anggota: 1 kontrol + 50 gangguan), diperbarui 4× sehari, via Open-Meteo Ensemble API (CC BY 4.0). Makin lebar kotak, makin tidak pasti prakiraannya. Nilai adalah prakiraan model grid ±25 km, bukan pengukuran di tempat.": "Source: ECMWF IFS ENS 0.25° (51 members: 1 control + 50 perturbed), updated 4× a day, via the Open-Meteo Ensemble API (CC BY 4.0). The wider the box, the more uncertain the forecast. Values are ±25 km grid model forecasts, not on-site measurements.",
