"Rumus:": "Formula:", "Emisi (Mg CO₂) = Σ [Luas deforestasi × (stok hutan − stok lahan terdeforestasi) + Luas degradasi × (stok primer − stok sekunder)] × 44/12 (metode beda stok, FREL 2022 / e-Learning KLHK \"Menghitung Emisi Karbon Hutan\").": "Emissions (Mg CO₂) = Σ [Deforestation area × (forest stock − deforested land stock) + Degradation area × (primary stock − secondary stock)] × 44/12 (stock-difference method, FREL 2022 / KLHK e-Learning \"Calculating Forest Carbon Emissions\").",
"• Kepadatan karbon: FREL 2022 (FRL ke-2 Indonesia, KLHK), biomassa AGB+BGB × fraksi karbon 0,47; kelas hutan = nilai Kalimantan, non-hutan = nilai nasional.": "• Carbon density: FREL 2022 (Indonesia's 2nd FRL, KLHK), AGB+BGB biomass × carbon fraction 0.47; forest classes = Kalimantan values, non-forest = national values.",
"• Data aktivitas: kehilangan tutupan pohon tahunan Hansen/UMD Global Forest Change v1.13 (piksel ±30 m, tajuk tahun 2000 ≥ 30%), luas piksel geodesik.": "• Activity data: annual tree cover loss from Hansen/UMD Global Forest Change v1.13 (±30 m pixels, canopy in 2000 ≥ 30%), geodesic pixel area.",
"• Kelas awal (tutupan lahan, dihitung lebih dulu): Peta Penutupan Lahan resmi KLHK skala 1:250.000 tahun awal periode (atau tahun terdekat sebelumnya). Bila peta KLHK belum tersedia untuk suatu lokasi, dipakai GLAD GLCLUC v2 sebagai proksi (pohon > 25 m = primer, 3–25 m = sekunder; lahan kering vs rawa) dan ditandai jelas di tabel tutupan lahan.": "• Starting classes (land cover, calculated first): official KLHK Land Cover Map at 1:250,000 for the period's start year (or the nearest earlier year). Where a KLHK map is not yet available for a location, GLAD GLCLUC v2 is used as a proxy (trees > 25 m = primary, 3–25 m = secondary; dryland vs swamp) and is clearly flagged in the land cover table.",
"• Kehilangan di hutan primer = degradasi (→ hutan sekunder); di hutan sekunder = deforestasi (→ PLK bercampur semak / belukar rawa). Kehilangan di areal bukan hutan tidak dihitung sebagai emisi.": "• Loss in primary forest = degradation (→ secondary forest); in secondary forest = deforestation (→ mixed dryland agriculture / swamp shrub). Loss in non-forest areas is not counted as emissions.",
"• Luas awal (kolom tahun awal) = luas kelas pada epoch GLCLU dikurangi kehilangan tutupan pohon antara epoch dan tahun awal periode.": "• Starting area (start-year column) = class area on the land cover map minus tree cover loss between the map year and the period's start year.",
"• Tidak mencakup emisi dekomposisi/kebakaran gambut, degradasi ringan di bawah tajuk, dan serapan dari pertumbuhan kembali. Data tahun berjalan menunggu rilis tahunan Hansen.": "• Does not include emissions from peat decomposition/fires, light under-canopy degradation, or removals from regrowth. Current-year data await the annual Hansen release.",
"• Parameter proyek (keefektifan 90%, kebocoran 5%, penyangga risiko 13,5%) mengikuti templat perhitungan karbon PRCF dan dapat diubah.": "• Project parameters (90% effectiveness, 5% leakage, 13.5% risk buffer) follow the PRCF carbon calculation template and can be changed.",
"Data FREL belum tersedia untuk: @.": "FREL data are not yet available for: @.",
