FHLang.tambah({ terapkan: false, kamus: { "Kehilangan tutupan pohon per tahun (Hansen GFC v# / citra, ha)": "Tree cover loss per year (Hansen GFC v# / imagery, ha)", "Total kehilangan tutupan pohon": "Total tree cover loss",
  "… mengubah kelas hutan (deforestasi/degradasi)": "… changing a forest class (deforestation/degradation)", "… tidak mengubah kelas (lahan bukan hutan / tetap hutan di peta KLHK)": "… not changing the class (non-forest land / still forest on the KLHK map)",
  "Kelas KLHK hanya berubah bila pohon hilang di kelas hutan. Pohon yang hilang di ladang/semak/rawa (sudah bukan hutan) tetap tercatat di baris bawah, tetapi tidak mengubah luas kelas – karena itu tabel kelas bisa tampak datar pada tahun tertentu. Pertumbuhan kembali (regenerasi) dan perubahan antar-kelas bukan hutan belum terekam peta KLHK 2020.": "KLHK classes only change when trees are lost in a forest class. Trees lost in fields/shrub/swamp (already non-forest) are still recorded in the rows below but do not change class areas – so the class table can look flat in some years. Regrowth and changes between non-forest classes are not captured by the 2020 KLHK map.",
  "Pembanding independen (Sentinel-2 # m)": "Independent comparison (Sentinel-2 # m)", "Peta tutupan lahan tahunan terpisah #–# untuk cek silang tren": "Separate annual land cover maps #–# to cross-check the trend",
  "Kelas (# kelas global)": "Class (# global classes)", "Perubahan #–#": "Change #–#", "Data pembanding belum tersedia.": "Comparison data not available yet.", "Air": "Water", "Pohon": "Trees", "Vegetasi tergenang": "Flooded vegetation", "Tanaman pertanian": "Crops", "Terbangun": "Built area", "Tanah terbuka": "Bare ground", "Awan": "Clouds", "Semak/padang rumput": "Rangeland/shrub",
  "Sumber: Impact Observatory, Microsoft & Esri – 10m Annual Land Use Land Cover V2 (Sentinel-2, CC BY 4.0). Peta ini dibuat ulang setiap tahun secara terpisah sehingga dapat dipakai memeriksa silang tren di atas. Kelasnya berbeda dengan KLHK (mis. ladang bera/semak berpohon dihitung \"Pohon\"), dan angka per tahun dapat naik-turun karena awan atau banjir musiman (air ↔ vegetasi tergenang di rawa) – bukan berarti lahan berubah. Akurasi global ±75–85%; dipakai sebagai pembanding, bukan pengganti peta resmi KLHK.": "Source: Impact Observatory, Microsoft & Esri – 10m Annual Land Use Land Cover V2 (Sentinel-2, CC BY 4.0). These maps are produced separately each year, so they can be used to cross-check the trend above. Classes differ from KLHK (e.g. wooded fallow/shrub counts as \"Trees\"), and yearly figures can fluctuate due to clouds or seasonal flooding (water ↔ flooded vegetation in swamps) – this does not mean the land changed. Global accuracy ±75–85%; used as a comparison, not a replacement for the official KLHK map.",
  "Keterbatasan: kelas KLHK hanya berubah bila tutupan pohon hilang di kelas hutan (data Hansen). Kehilangan pohon di lahan yang sudah bukan hutan (ladang, semak, rawa) dicatat terpisah per tahun tetapi tidak mengubah kelas; pertumbuhan kembali (regenerasi) dan perubahan antar-kelas bukan hutan (mis. ladang → kebun) belum terekam karena acuan resmi yang tersedia baru Peta KLHK 2020. Peta KLHK tahunan (PL 2021–2024) akan dipakai langsung bila tersedia. Pembanding independen: peta tahunan Sentinel-2 10 m Impact Observatory/Esri (2017–2023).": "Limitation: KLHK classes only change when tree cover is lost in a forest class (Hansen data). Tree loss on land that is already non-forest (fields, shrub, swamp) is recorded separately per year but does not change the class; regrowth and changes between non-forest classes (e.g. field → plantation) are not yet captured because the only official reference available is the 2020 KLHK map. Annual KLHK maps (LC 2021–2024) will be used directly once available. Independent comparison: Impact Observatory/Esri annual Sentinel-2 10 m maps (2017–2023)." } });
